sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as Wallet (holder)
  participant I as Issuer (Inji Certify / mock / Walt.id)
  participant V as Verifier (Inji Verify / mock / Walt.id)
  Note over W,V: OpenID4VCI (issue)
  W->>I: Credential offer (QR or deep link)
  W->>I: Issuer metadata
  W->>I: Token request (pre-authorized code or eSignet login)
  I-->>W: access_token, c_nonce
  W->>I: Credential request + proof of possession
  I-->>W: Signed credential (W3C VC, SD-JWT or mDoc)
  Note over W,V: OpenID4VP (present)
  V->>W: Authorization request (presentation definition, nonce)
  W->>V: vp_token (requested claims, bound to the nonce)
  V-->>W: Verdict (signature, expiry, type, holder binding)
